  str_season_maze_s1_help_title_605 = "Dream Aid Item",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_101 = "The unstable elements from past dreams still linger in the realm of dreams, poised to strike reality at any moment. With the Enlightener's aid, Navigators can now venture back into the dreams to partake in diverse exploration events, enhancing their prowess within the dreams. By defeating the Ultimate Dream Devourer, there's a chance to restore stability to the dreams' energy.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_102 = "Navigators will lead the Enlightener, harnessing the power of the Dream Divination Card, to traverse diverse dream realms and trigger events within them. Throughout the exploration, Navigators can summon Aurorians and collect Dream Gear, Dream Orbs, and other dream resources to enhance their abilities. After ultimately defeating the Dream Devourer and the Ultimate Dream Devourer, the Daydream be completed, yielding rich rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_201 = "The Enlightener will evaluate the Navigators' performance in dreams and record their scores. Accumulate sufficient scores to get corresponding rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_202 = "After each exploration, the Enlightener will record the corresponding score based on the Dream Level and Exploration Progress. Accumulate enough scores to reach certain milestones and gain corresponding rewards. Additionally, you can get extra scores by completing Dream Quests.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_203 = "When your accumulated scores reach certain milestones, you can claim the corresponding rewards. More reward milestones will unlock at regular intervals.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_204 = "Within dreams, there are various Dream Quests to undertake, which grant additional scores on completion.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_301 = "Dreams are structured into various levels. The higher the level, the harder the challenge, and the more scores earned upon completion. Within the Dream Level screen, you can view the active Ultimate Dream Devourer on each level to devise your exploration strategy accordingly.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_302 = "You'll start at Dream Level 1 and unlock the next level upon completing the current one, and some levels will open over time. The Dream Orb feature will be available when Dream Level 3 is unlocked, providing support for your exploration.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_303 = "When entering a dream, you need to select 4 Aurorians to form the initial lineup for exploration. Aurorians deployed will inherit their Breakthrough Levels from outside dreams but won't inherit other cultivated stats or levels.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_401 = "During exploration, Navigators can control themselves and bring the Enlightener to the journey.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_402 = "The Enlightener divides a dream into different Dream Realms based on fluctuations in dream energy. Navigators can only traverse between Dream Realms, each triggering different events.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_403 = "Navigators can use the power of Dream Divination Cards to move between different Dream Realms. The Action Steps on the Dream Divination Cards determine the number of Dream Realms Navigators can move between, with some cards also offering additional resources or special effects. At the start of each round, the Enlightener will draw a certain number of Dream Divination Cards from the card deck, and Navigators can select one to play it or drag it directly onto the screen to execute its effect.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_404 = "Navigators can collect diverse resources within dreams. Dream Particles can purchase various items, Dream Insight enhances the Exploration Level, Particle Catchers boost the amount of Dream Particles obtained per round, and Resonance guarantees the safety and stability of navigation within dreams.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_405 = "In the Tool Pouch, you can view the Aurorians deployed in this exploration, the Dream Gear acquired, and the Dream Divination Cards added to the deck.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_406 = "Memories and emotions left behind by the original dreamers are enveloped layer by layer in dream energy, forming Dream Orbs. Navigators can view the Dream Orbs obtained in this exploration here and equip or synthesize them.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_407 = "Dream Devourers will strike Navigators after a set number of rounds. Only by defeating the Dream Devourers can Navigators continue their dream exploration. The Ultimate Dream Devourer is the final encounter. Defeat it to complete this exploration, gaining scores based on dream level and exploration progress.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_408 = "Here, Navigators can view the battlefield conditions and enemy information of this battle, allowing them to fine-tune their tactics. Navigators can gain corresponding rewards upon challenge completion, but upon failure, they need to consume Resonance for another attempt.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_409 = "Dream Insight gained during explorations can elevate Navigators' Exploration Level, raising the levels of Aurorians and gear and unlocking new Dream Divination Cards and Dream Aid Items to bolster the Daydreams.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_501 = "Navigators can enter Dangerous Dream Realms to battle enemies and gain the chance to choose one Dream Gear upon victory.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_502 = "When Navigators enter Unknown Dream Realms, random events will be triggered. Some events require drawing 3 Dream Divination Cards and determining the sum of points. Success in the determination grants corresponding rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_503 = "When entering Resource Dream Realms, Navigators can gain various types of resource rewards, including Dream Particles, Dream Insights, and Dream Orbs. The more steps are taken before entering this Dream Realm, the richer the rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_504 = "When entering Unexplored Dream Realms, Navigators can deploy Aurorians to perform quests for continuous gains. During deployment, Aurorians cannot engage in battle and will automatically return after 5 rounds.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_505 = "When entering Treasure Dream Realms, Navigators can choose one reward from various options to obtain.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_506 = "When entering the Dream Realm Tunnel, Navigators delay the Dream Devourer's assault by 1 round.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_507 = "Entering the Blank Dream Realm will not trigger any effects.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_508 = "In the Divination Dream Realm, Navigators can spend Dream Particles to reset or remove existing Dream Divination Cards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_509 = "In Trade Dream Realms, Navigators can exchange various types of Dream Orbs with each other.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_510 = "Safe Dream Realm is where Navigators recuperate, allowing them to summon Aurorians, purchase items, buy medicines, or resurrect Aurorians to enhance their strength. In addition, infusing Dream Particles into the Dream Forge can unlock more powerful items for future challenges.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_601 = "Navigators can summon Aurorians to join their lineup. Aurorians deployed will inherit their Breakthrough Levels from outside dreams but won't inherit other cultivated stats or levels. Increase your Exploration Level to raise the level of Aurorians and their gear in dreams.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_602 = "Dream Gear is the precious knowledge and valuable relics left behind by Dream Wayfarers brave enough to explore dreams in the river of time. It can trigger various effects to assist navigators in their Daydreams.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_603 = "Navigators can use the power of Dream Divination Cards to move between different Dream Realms. The Action Steps on the Dream Divination Cards determine the number of Dream Realms Navigators can move between, with some cards also offering additional resources or special effects, including but not limited to Dream Particles, Particle Catchers, Dream Insights, Resonance, etc.",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_604 = "Memories and emotions left behind by the original dreamers are enveloped layer by layer in dream energy, forming Dream Orbs. Dream Orbs can enhance the Navigators' combat power in a dream, so be careful not to let the Dream Devourer pick them up!",
  str_season_maze_s1_help_disc_605 = "When brought into the dreams, real-world items are sometimes weathered by the dream energy, forming the Dream Aid Items. Each Dream Aid Item features unique assisting effects. Use them wisely to gain support in your explorations.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010101 = "Tip: You have successfully reached the intertwined space of dreams. Here, you can find many dreams you've encountered before. Please follow the guidance of the Enlightener to experience diverse exploration events and boost your strength. Aim to vanquish the Ultimate Dream Devourer and restore the stability of dream energy.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010102 = "Tip: Tap here to land in the dream and start your exploration.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010103 = "After each exploration, your performance in the dream will be evaluated, and you'll receive scores accordingly. You can get the corresponding exploration rewards once your accumulated scores reach certain milestones.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010104 = "Extra Tip: Tap on Event Info for more details about the Echoes of a Dream.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010105 = "Tip: Tap here to land in the dream if you're ready.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010201 = "Tip: It seems you've already discovered that you can view Dream Quests here—complete Dream Quests to earn corresponding scores.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010202 = "Tip: When your accumulated scores reach certain milestones, you can claim the corresponding rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010203 = "Suggestion: There are various Dream Quests in dreams. As your Enlightener, I suggest that you complete Dream Quests to get more scores.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010204 = "Tip: Here, you can view the scores required for the next special milestone and its corresponding rewards. The milestones will unlock automatically after a certain time. After claiming all current rewards, you can check the countdown to unlock the next milestone.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010301 = "Tip: Typically, dreams are structured into various levels. The higher the level, the harder the challenge, and the more scores earned upon completion. Only after completing the current level can you challenge the next one. Some levels will open gradually after a certain period.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010302 = "Situation analysis in progress... Current dream level detected: Level 1. As your Enlightener, I advise you to start your challenge from this level.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010303 = "Situation analysis in progress... Detected Ultimate Dream Devourer wreaking havoc in this dream. Defeat the Ultimate Dream Devourer to restore tranquility to the dream and complete this exploration. Tap here to view more detailed information about the Ultimate Dream Devourer.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010304 = "Tip: Tap here to switch dream levels. Complete exploration of the current level to unlock the next dream level for entry at the designated time.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010305 = "Suggestion: Now, with me by your side, begin your exploration from Dream Level 1.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_circle_90010401 = "Situation analysis in progress... Successfully landed at the starting point of the dream. Fear not; I will fight by your side as you explore the dream.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_circle_90010402 = "Commentary: I divide the dream into different Dream Realms based on fluctuations in dream energy. Please note that we can only traverse between these Dream Realms, each triggering different events. Would you like to know what events await you in this Dream Realm?",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010403 = "Tip: By tapping on the Dream Realm, you can access its name and detailed information. If you encounter unknown Dream Realms later on, you can still tap to view them.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010404 = "Commentary: I can monitor and predict the flow of dream energy, generating these Dream Divination Cards for you. The Action Steps in the upper left corner represent the number of dream realms you can traverse, while special effects attached to the card will be displayed in the lower right corner. By following the instructions on the Dream Divination Cards, you'll avoid getting stuck in one spot.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010405 = "Commentary: Select a Dream Divination Card and then tap Play to execute all effects on that card. You can also achieve the same effect by dragging the Dream Divination Card to the center of the screen. At the start of each round, I will select a certain number of Dream Divination Cards from the card deck for you.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010406 = "Tip: Here, you can see all the resources you have obtained during this exploration, such as Dream Particles, Particle Catchers, Resonance, Exploration Level, Dream Insights, etc. It's okay if you're not familiar with them now. I believe that as you delve deeper into exploration, you will surely understand how to obtain and utilize them.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010407 = "Tip: Tap on Event Info for further details.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010408 = "Tip: Now, please select a Dream Divination Card to play and see what happens.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010501 = "Commentary: Please observe the Dream Divination Card carefully. The Action Steps in the upper left corner of the card represent the number of dream realms you can traverse. When encountering a fork in the road, you can choose one path to proceed. At the end of some forks lies a Teleportation Dream Realm, which can transport you to other Dream Realms.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010502 = "Commentary: In addition to the Action Steps, the Dream Divination Card also offers rich resource rewards such as Dream Particles, Particle Catchers, Resonance, Dream Insights, and more. The numbers below represent the amount of rewards you can obtain.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010503 = "Tip: Here, you can view the Dream Insights obtained during this exploration. When Dream Insights reach the standard for an upgrade, it will automatically level up and clear the accumulated Dream Insights. Elevating the Dream Insight level can raise the level of Aurorians and gear and obtain other resource rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010504 = "Warning: To ensure your safety within a dream, it's essential to maintain sufficient Resonance with the dream. If Resonance drops to 0, exploration will terminate automatically. Each round of battle consumes 1 point of Resonance. In case of failure against the Dream Devourer, you can also spend Resonance for another attempt.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010505 = "Commentary: Dream Particles are the smallest units that make up dream energy, exchangeable for various items within dreams. Particle Catchers represent the amount of Dream Particles that can be captured during dream events. At the end of each round, a settlement will occur and grant you the same amount of Dream Particles as the Particle Catchers.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010506 = "Tip: In the Tool Pouch, you can check the Aurorians, Dream Gear, and Dream Divination Cards that have been added to the lineup. After exploration concludes, the Tool Pouch will be cleared.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010507 = "Warning: The Dream Devourer has detected our movements and will strike after a certain number of rounds. I believe that you can command your team to defeat it. The Ultimate Dream Devourer is the final Dream Devourer coming to attack, and only by defeating it can this exploration be concluded.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010601 = "Warning: The Dream Devourer is approaching. Please prepare yourself. As your Enlightener, I will fight alongside you to defeat it. Remember, flexibly using the resources at your disposal will significantly enhance our combat effectiveness.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010602 = "Commentary: Here, you can view the type of battle in this encounter. As your Enlightener, I have to remind you that it's more challenging to conquer the Dream Devourer than Dangerous Dream Realms. You must defeat the Dream Devourer to continue the exploration. The Ultimate Dream Devourer represents the final challenge, the completion of which concludes this exploration.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010603 = "Tip: Here, you can view the battlefield conditions and enemy information of this battle to fine-tune your tactics accordingly. As your Enlightener, I believe you can devise the perfect strategy for combat.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010604 = "Tip: Victory against the Dream Devourer yields abundant rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s1_guide_warn_90010605 = "With Anticipation: Let's defeat the Dream Devourer together."
